  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "When First Hair falls after blocking five finger fist heart sword for Lang Ya land spirit, she kneels beside him, hugs his chest, and finds his body already filled with sword energy and no longer alive. She cries his name until other hairy man Gu Immortals turn from Qin Bai Sheng to console her, calling her Second Hair. After Lang Ya land spirit closes First Hair’s eyelids, she screams, falls on the corpse, and faints. Fang Yuan judges that Lang Ya land spirit raised these hairy man Gu Immortals as refinement assistants, expert at refining Gu and not specialized in battle.",
